@startuml F0.2-a-reset-email-cadastrado
title F0.2-a — Solicitar reset (e-mail cadastrado) — happy path
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Usuário" as Usuario
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "AuthController" as AuthController
participant "ForgotPasswordUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Usuario -> WebApp: e-mail / Enviar link
WebApp -> AuthController: POST /auth/recuperar-senha
AuthController -> UC: execute(email, ip)
UC -> Postgres: SELECT usuario BY email
Postgres --> UC: usuario encontrado

note right of UC
  JWT de reset gerado em memória
  (não persiste antes do uso)
  RN-F0.2-02
end note

UC -> Postgres: INSERT audit_log\n(iam.password_reset_requested)\nINSERT outbox_event\n(PASSWORD_RESET)
note right of UC
  TX atômica; e-mail assíncrono
  via Outbox — RN-F0.2-03
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> AuthController: ok
AuthController --> WebApp: 202 Accepted
WebApp --> Usuario: banner neutro\n(RN-F0.2-01 anti-enumeração)

@enduml
